# Dockerfile context = repo root. Default everything OUT, then opt in
# only the paths the multi-stage build actually needs (broker module +
# the Dockerfile itself). Keeps node_modules, dist outputs, design docs,
# tests, and IDE state out of every build layer's hash.
**

!broker/**
!docker/Dockerfile

# Even within broker/, drop things the binary doesn't need:
broker/**/*_test.go
broker/cmd/**/testdata/**
